Changelog: 04-11-2026 21:23:19

Fixed. The tests' fake console finds a port free for both TCP and UDP also on GitHub's Windows runners, where CI
Windows Portable failed once (04-11-2026, no free port): Windows hands out TCP ports in order and a run of them can
be reserved for UDP, so every other try now asks for a free UDP port first, and the error names the last refusal.
The app itself is unchanged.

